    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) signed a Memorandum of Understanding with Marketing Africa Ltd (MA Ltd) to co-create and offer media, communications, and leadership courses and events that are aimed at upskilling and building the professional capacity of MA Ltd. members. The signing was held at the Aga Khan University Campus in Nairobi on 31 st  October 2023.",
